# Only the engine and the synthetic demo may be tracked at the repository root.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/CODEX.md
!/MIGRATION.md
!/README.md
!/HACKATHON.md
!/ROADMAP.md
!/.codex/
!/.agents/
!/.github/
!/_workbench/
!/knowledge/
!/演練資料_AcmeRobotics/
!/演練資料_AcmeRobotics_五輪Demo/

# 公開合成示範 repo；禁止加入真實客戶 Data Room 或憑證。

# 系統與衍生物
**/.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 執行期 log（每次跑都變、無備份價值）
*.log
_workbench/server.log

# 引擎長效 token（憑證，絕不入版控）
_workbench/token

# Credentials and runtime output
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.codex/auth.json
**/run.events.jsonl
/_trash/
/HANDOFF.md
/*.xlsx
/*.pptx

**/mine-check.md

!/.claude/
!/CLAUDE.md
_workbench/settings.json
_workbench/settings.json.tmp
**/_analysis/runs/
.codex/agents/_generated/

_workbench/.rule-approvals.json*
knowledge/learned/*.tmp
knowledge/skills/_proposed/
# Private project conversations and disposable search databases
**/_analysis/conversations/
**/_analysis/retrieval/
**/_analysis/index/*.meta
**/_analysis/index/*.tmp

_workbench/.tessdata/

# Private learned memory, summaries, background jobs, rebuildable FTS index
/_private_memory/

# Reproducible visual-page cache
**/_analysis/index/_render/

